flowchart TB
  Tenant[Tenant] --> GET[GET /subscriptions/recommendation]
  GET --> Optional[Optional: ?blocked=limit:orders_per_day\nor feature:reports]
  Optional --> recommendPlan[recommendPlan helper]
  recommendPlan --> Usage[Usage snapshot\nentitlements]
  recommendPlan --> Plans[Plans by tenant_type\nordered by display_order]
  Usage --> Logic{usage >= 80% or\nover limit?}
  Logic -->|yes| Resolve[resolvesLimits\nrecommend next tier]
  Logic -->|no| Features{missing\nreports/smart_reorder/multi_branch?}
  Features -->|yes| Upgrades[upgrades\nlowest plan that unlocks]
  Features -->|no| Default[Free trial → recommend Gold\npaid default: silver → gold ladder]
  Resolve --> Response[recommendedPlanCode, reason\ncomparedToCurrent]
  Upgrades --> Response
  Default --> Response
  Response --> UI[SubscriptionInfo, UpgradeModal\nshow Recommended badge]
